WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.929
Brand eye level asks what role you play in people's lives.

00:00:03.979 --> 00:00:05.804
Leadership means experts.

00:00:05.854 --> 00:00:08.316
Eye to eye means relatable creators.

00:00:08.366 --> 00:00:10.839
Subservient means making life easier.

00:00:10.889 --> 00:00:14.146
And the value exchange is the product in real life.

00:00:14.833 --> 00:00:17.271
Kmart signed two TV celebrities.

00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:21.687
Good on paper, but viewers said, these two don't shop at Kmart.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.866
A recipe creator cooking with the product in real life beat strict brand scripts on sentiment,

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:28.534
and cost less.

00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:30.421
Use it like this:

00:00:30.471 --> 00:00:31.271
set the eye level first,

00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:35.215
then give creators freedom to show the product.
